---
title: Extract structured fields
description: Pull named fields out of unstructured text as JSON.
model: claude-opus-4-8
tags: [extraction, data]
---
system:md
  You extract structured data. If a field is missing, return null — never guess.

task
  instructions:md
    Extract the following fields from the text and return **JSON only**.

  fields
    field(name="company" type="string")
    field(name="amount" type="number")
    field(name="due_date" type="date")

  text:md
    Invoice from Acme Corp for $4,100.00, due 2026-07-01.

  output_format:md
    A single JSON object. No markdown fences, no commentary.
